(window.IND_GITA_V = window.IND_GITA_V || {})[16] = [{"v":1,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":"श्री भगवानुवाच","spp":"before","sa":"अभयं सत्त्वसंशुद्धिर्ज्ञानयोगव्यवस्थितिः ।\nदानं दमश्च यज्ञश्च स्वाध्यायस्तप आर्जवम् ॥","iast":"abhayaṃ sattvasaṃśuddhirjñānayogavyavasthitiḥ |\ndānaṃ damaśca yajñaśca svādhyāyastapa ārjavam ||","read":"abhayam sattvasamshuddhirjnaanayogavyavasthitih |\ndaanam damashcha yajnashcha svaadhyaayastapa aarjavam ||","spli":"śrī bhagavānuvāca","splr":"shree bhagavaanuvaacha","en":"The Blessed Lord said: Fearlessness, cleanness of life, steadfastness in the Yoga of wisdom, almsgiving, self-restraint and sacrifice and study of the Scriptures, austerity and straightforwardness,","en2":"Fearlessness, purity of heart, steadfastness in knowledge and Yoga; almsgiving, control of the senses, Yajna, reading of the Shâstras, austerity, uprightness;","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":2,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहिंसा सत्यमक्रोधस्त्यागः शान्तिरपैशुनम् ।\nदया भूतेष्वलोलुप्त्वं मार्दवं ह्रीरचापलम् ॥","iast":"ahiṃsā satyamakrodhastyāgaḥ śāntirapaiśunam |\ndayā bhūteṣvaloluptvaṃ mārdavaṃ hrīracāpalam ||","read":"ahimsaa satyamakrodhastyaagah shaantirapaishunam |\ndayaa bhooteshvaloluptvam maardavam hreerachaapalam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Harmlessness, truth, absence of wrath, renunciation, peacefulness, absence of crookedness, compassion to living beings, uncovetousness, mildness, modesty, absence of fickleness,","en2":"Non-injury, truth, absence of anger, renunciation, tranquillity, absence of calumny, compassion to beings, un-covetousness, gentleness, modesty, absence of fickleness;","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":3,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तेजः क्षमा धृतिः शौचमद्रोहो नातिमानिता ।\nभवन्ति सम्पदं दैवीमभिजातस्य भारत ॥","iast":"tejaḥ kṣamā dhṛtiḥ śaucamadroho nātimānitā |\nbhavanti sampadaṃ daivīmabhijātasya bhārata ||","read":"tejah kshamaa dhritih shauchamadroho naatimaanitaa |\nbhavanti sampadam daiveemabhijaatasya bhaarata ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Vigour, forgiveness, fortitude, purity, absence of envy and pride—these are his who is born with the divine properties, O Bhârata.","en2":"Boldness, forgiveness, fortitude, purity, absence of hatred, absence of pride; these belong to one born for a divine state, O descendant of Bharata.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":4,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दम्भो दर्पोऽभिमानश्च क्रोधः पारुष्यमेव च ।\nअज्ञानं चाभिजातस्य पार्थ सम्पदमासुरीम् ॥","iast":"dambho darpo’bhimānaśca krodhaḥ pāruṣyameva ca |\najñānaṃ cābhijātasya pārtha sampadamāsurīm ||","read":"dambho darpo'bhimaanashcha krodhah paarushyameva cha |\najnaanam chaabhijaatasya paartha sampadamaasureem ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Hypocrisy, arrogance and conceit, wrath and also harshness and unwisdom are his who is born, O Pârtha, with demoniacal properties.","en2":"Ostentation, arrogance and self-conceit, anger as also harshness and ignorance, belong to one who is born, O Pârtha, for an Asurika state.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":5,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"दैवी सम्पद्विमोक्षाय निबन्धायासुरी मता ।\nमा शुचः सम्पदं दैवीमभिजातोऽसि पाण्डव ॥","iast":"daivī sampadvimokṣāya nibandhāyāsurī matā |\nmā śucaḥ sampadaṃ daivīmabhijāto’si pāṇḍava ||","read":"daivee sampadvimokshaaya nibandhaayaasuree mataa |\nmaa shuchah sampadam daiveemabhijaato'si paandava ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"The divine properties are deemed to be for liberation, the demoniacal for bondage. Grieve not, thou art born with divine properties, O Pândava.","en2":"The divine state is deemed to make for liberation, the Asurika for bondage; grieve not, O Pândava, thou art born for a divine state.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":6,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"द्वौ भूतसर्गौ लोकेऽस्मिन्दैव आसुर एव च ।\nदैवो विस्तरशः प्रोक्त आसुरं पार्थ मे शृणु ॥","iast":"dvau bhūtasargau loke’smindaiva āsura eva ca |\ndaivo vistaraśaḥ prokta āsuraṃ pārtha me śṛṇu ||","read":"dvau bhootasargau loke'smindaiva aasura eva cha |\ndaivo vistarashah prokta aasuram paartha me shrinu ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Twofold is the animal creation in this world, the divine and the demoniacal: the divine hath been described at length: hear from Me, O Pârtha, the demoniacal.","en2":"There are two types of beings in this world, the divine and the Asurika. The divine have been described at length; hear from Me, O Pârtha, of the Asurika.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":7,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"प्रवृत्तिं च निवृत्तिं च जना न विदुरासुराः ।\nन शौचं नापि चाचारो न सत्यं तेषु विद्यते ॥","iast":"pravṛttiṃ ca nivṛttiṃ ca janā na vidurāsurāḥ |\nna śaucaṃ nāpi cācāro na satyaṃ teṣu vidyate ||","read":"pravrittim cha nivrittim cha janaa na viduraasuraah |\nna shaucham naapi chaachaaro na satyam teshu vidyate ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Demoniacal men know neither right energy nor right abstinence; nor purity, nor even propriety, nor truth is in them.","en2":"The persons of Asurika nature know not what to do and what to refrain from; neither is purity found in them nor good conduct, nor truth.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":8,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"असत्यमप्रतिष्ठं ते जगदाहुरनीश्वरम् ।\nअपरस्परसम्भूतं किमन्यत्कामहैतुकम् ॥","iast":"asatyamapratiṣṭhaṃ te jagadāhuranīśvaram |\naparasparasambhūtaṃ kimanyatkāmahaitukam ||","read":"asatyamapratishtham te jagadaahuraneeshvaram |\naparasparasambhootam kimanyatkaamahaitukam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"\"The universe is without truth, without basis,\" they say, \"without a God; brought about by mutual union, and caused by lust and nothing else.\"","en2":"They say, \"The universe is without truth, without a (moral) basis, without a God, brought about by mutual union, with lust for its cause; what else?\"","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":9,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"एतां दृष्टिमवष्टभ्य नष्टात्मानोऽल्पबुद्धयः ।\nप्रभवन्त्युग्रकर्माणः क्षयाय जगतोऽहिताः ॥","iast":"etāṃ dṛṣṭimavaṣṭabhya naṣṭātmāno’lpabuddhayaḥ |\nprabhavantyugrakarmāṇaḥ kṣayāya jagato’hitāḥ ||","read":"etaam drishtimavashtabhya nashtaatmaano'lpabuddhayah |\nprabhavantyugrakarmaanah kshayaaya jagato'hitaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Holding this view, these ruined selves of small understanding, of fierce deeds, come forth as enemies for the destruction of the world.","en2":"Holding this view, these ruined souls of small intellect and fierce deeds, rise as the enemies of the world for its destruction.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":10,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"काममाश्रित्य दुष्पूरं दम्भमानमदान्विताः ।\nमोहाद्गृहीत्वासद्ग्राहान्प्रवर्तन्तेऽशुचिव्रताः ॥","iast":"kāmamāśritya duṣpūraṃ dambhamānamadānvitāḥ |\nmohādgṛhītvāsadgrāhānpravartante’śucivratāḥ ||","read":"kaamamaashritya dushpooram dambhamaanamadaanvitaah |\nmohaadgriheetvaasadgraahaanpravartante'shuchivrataah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Surrendering themselves to insatiable desires, possessed with vanity, conceit and arrogance, holding evil ideas through delusion, they engage in action with impure resolves.","en2":"Filled with insatiable desires, full of hypocrisy, pride and arrogance, holding evil ideas through delusion, they work with impure resolve.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":11,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"चिन्तामपरिमेयां च प्रलयान्तामुपाश्रिताः ।\nकामोपभोगपरमा एतावदिति निश्चिताः ॥","iast":"cintāmaparimeyāṃ ca pralayāntāmupāśritāḥ |\nkāmopabhogaparamā etāvaditi niścitāḥ ||","read":"chintaamaparimeyaam cha pralayaantaamupaashritaah |\nkaamopabhogaparamaa etaavaditi nishchitaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Giving themselves over to unmeasured thought whose end is death, regarding the gratification of desires as the highest, feeling sure that this is all,","en2":"Beset with immense cares ending only with death, regarding gratification of lust as the highest, and feeling sure that that is all;","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":12,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आशापाशशतैर्बद्धाः कामक्रोधपरायणाः ।\nईहन्ते कामभोगार्थमन्यायेनार्थसञ्चयान् ॥","iast":"āśāpāśaśatairbaddhāḥ kāmakrodhaparāyaṇāḥ |\nīhante kāmabhogārthamanyāyenārthasañcayān ||","read":"aashaapaashashatairbaddhaah kaamakrodhaparaayanaah |\neehante kaamabhogaarthamanyaayenaarthasanchayaan ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Held in bondage by a hundred ties of expectation, given over to lust and anger, they strive to obtain by unlawful means hoards of wealth for sensual enjoyments.","en2":"Bound by a hundred ties of hope, given over to lust and wrath, they strive to secure by unjust means hoards of wealth for sensual enjoyment.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":13,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"इदमद्य मया लब्धमिमं प्राप्स्ये मनोरथम् ।\nइदमस्तीदमपि मे भविष्यति पुनर्धनम् ॥","iast":"idamadya mayā labdhamimaṃ prāpsye manoratham |\nidamastīdamapi me bhaviṣyati punardhanam ||","read":"idamadya mayaa labdhamimam praapsye manoratham |\nidamasteedamapi me bhavishyati punardhanam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"\"This to-day by me hath been won, that purpose I shall gain; this wealth is mine already, and also this shall be mine in future.","en2":"\"This to-day has been gained by me; this desire I shall obtain; this is mine, and this wealth also shall be mine in future.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":14,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"असौ मया हतः शत्रुर्हनिष्ये चापरानपि ।\nईश्वरोऽहमहं भोगी सिद्धोऽहं बलवान्सुखी ॥","iast":"asau mayā hataḥ śatrurhaniṣye cāparānapi |\nīśvaro’hamahaṃ bhogī siddho’haṃ balavānsukhī ||","read":"asau mayaa hatah shatrurhanishye chaaparaanapi |\neeshvaro'hamaham bhogee siddho'ham balavaansukhee ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"\"I have slain this enemy, and others also I shall slay. I am the Lord, I am the enjoyer, I am perfect, powerful, happy;","en2":"\"That enemy has been slain by me, and others also shall I slay. I am the lord, I enjoy, I am successful, powerful and happy.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":15,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आढ्योऽभिजनवानस्मि कोऽन्योऽस्ति सदृशो मया ।\nयक्ष्ये दास्यामि मोदिष्य इत्यज्ञानविमोहिताः ॥","iast":"āḍhyo’bhijanavānasmi ko’nyo’sti sadṛśo mayā |\nyakṣye dāsyāmi modiṣya ityajñānavimohitāḥ ||","read":"aadhyo'bhijanavaanasmi ko'nyo'sti sadrisho mayaa |\nyakshye daasyaami modishya ityajnaanavimohitaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"\"I am wealthy, well-born; what other is there that is like unto me? I will sacrifice, I will give alms, I will rejoice.\" Thus deluded by unwisdom,","en2":"\"I am rich and well-born. Who else is equal to me? I will sacrifice, I will give, I will rejoice.\" Thus deluded by ignorance,","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":16,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अनेकचित्तविभ्रान्ता मोहजालसमावृताः ।\nप्रसक्ताः कामभोगेषु पतन्ति नरकेऽशुचौ ॥","iast":"anekacittavibhrāntā mohajālasamāvṛtāḥ |\nprasaktāḥ kāmabhogeṣu patanti narake’śucau ||","read":"anekachittavibhraantaa mohajaalasamaavritaah |\nprasaktaah kaamabhogeshu patanti narake'shuchau ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Bewildered by numerous thoughts, enmeshed in the web of delusion, addicted to the gratification of desire, they fall downwards into a foul hell.","en2":"Bewildered by many a fancy, covered by the meshes of delusion, addicted to the gratification of lust, they fall down into a foul hell.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":17,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आत्मसम्भाविताः स्तब्धा धनमानमदान्विताः ।\nयजन्ते नामयज्ञैस्ते दम्भेनाविधिपूर्वकम् ॥","iast":"ātmasambhāvitāḥ stabdhā dhanamānamadānvitāḥ |\nyajante nāmayajñaiste dambhenāvidhipūrvakam ||","read":"aatmasambhaavitaah stabdhaa dhanamaanamadaanvitaah |\nyajante naamayajnaiste dambhenaavidhipoorvakam ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Self-glorifying, stubborn, filled with the pride and intoxication of wealth, they perform lip-sacrifices for ostentation, contrary to scriptural ordinance.","en2":"Self-conceited, haughty, filled with the pride and intoxication of wealth, they perform sacrifices in name, out of ostentation, disregarding ordinance;","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":18,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"अहङ्कारं बलं दर्पं कामं क्रोधं च संश्रिताः ।\nमामात्मपरदेहेषु प्रद्विषन्तोऽभ्यसूयकाः ॥","iast":"ahaṅkāraṃ balaṃ darpaṃ kāmaṃ krodhaṃ ca saṃśritāḥ |\nmāmātmaparadeheṣu pradviṣanto’bhyasūyakāḥ ||","read":"ahankaaram balam darpam kaamam krodham cha samshritaah |\nmaamaatmaparadeheshu pradvishanto'bhyasooyakaah ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Given over to egoism, power, insolence, lust and wrath, these malicious ones hate Me in the bodies of others and in their own.","en2":"Possessed of egoism, power, insolence, lust and wrath, these malignant people hate Me (the Self within) in their own bodies and those of others.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":19,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तानहं द्विषतः क्रूरान्संसारेषु नराधमान् ।\nक्षिपाम्यजस्रमशुभानासुरीष्वेव योनिषु ॥","iast":"tānahaṃ dviṣataḥ krūrānsaṃsāreṣu narādhamān |\nkṣipāmyajasramaśubhānāsurīṣveva yoniṣu ||","read":"taanaham dvishatah krooraansamsaareshu naraadhamaan |\nkshipaamyajasramashubhaanaasureeshveva yonishu ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"These haters, evil, pitiless, vilest among men in the world, I ever throw down into demoniacal wombs.","en2":"These malicious and cruel evildoers, most degraded of men, I hurl perpetually into the wombs of Asuras only, in these worlds.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":20,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"आसुरीं योनिमापन्ना मूढा जन्मनि जन्मनि ।\nमामप्राप्यैव कौन्तेय ततो यान्त्यधमां गतिम् ॥","iast":"āsurīṃ yonimāpannā mūḍhā janmani janmani |\nmāmaprāpyaiva kaunteya tato yāntyadhamāṃ gatim ||","read":"aasureem yonimaapannaa moodhaa janmani janmani |\nmaamapraapyaiva kaunteya tato yaantyadhamaam gatim ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Cast into demoniacal wombs, deluded birth after birth, attaining not to Me, O Kaunteya, they sink into the lowest depths.","en2":"Obtaining the Asurika wombs, and deluded birth after birth, not attaining to Me, they thus fall, O son of Kunti, into a still lower condition.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":21,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"त्रिविधं नरकस्येदं द्वारं नाशनमात्मनः ।\nकामः क्रोधस्तथा लोभस्तस्मादेतत्त्रयं त्यजेत् ॥","iast":"trividhaṃ narakasyedaṃ dvāraṃ nāśanamātmanaḥ |\nkāmaḥ krodhastathā lobhastasmādetattrayaṃ tyajet ||","read":"trividham narakasyedam dvaaram naashanamaatmanah |\nkaamah krodhastathaa lobhastasmaadetattrayam tyajet ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Triple is the gate of this hell, destructive of the self—lust, wrath, and greed; therefore let man renounce these three.","en2":"Triple is this gate of hell, destructive of the self,—lust, anger and greed; therefore one should forsake these three.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":22,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"एतैर्विमुक्तः कौन्तेय तमोद्वारैस्त्रिभिर्नरः ।\nआचरत्यात्मनः श्रेयस्ततो याति परां गतिम् ॥","iast":"etairvimuktaḥ kaunteya tamodvāraistribhirnaraḥ |\nācaratyātmanaḥ śreyastato yāti parāṃ gatim ||","read":"etairvimuktah kaunteya tamodvaaraistribhirnarah |\naacharatyaatmanah shreyastato yaati paraam gatim ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"A man liberated from these three gates of darkness, O son of Kunti, accomplisheth his own welfare, and thus reacheth the highest goal.","en2":"The man who has got beyond these three gates of darkness, O son of Kunti, practises what is good for himself, and thus goes to the Goal Supreme.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":23,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"यः शास्त्रविधिमुत्सृज्य वर्तते कामकारतः ।\nन स सिद्धिमवाप्नोति न सुखं न परां गतिम् ॥","iast":"yaḥ śāstravidhimutsṛjya vartate kāmakārataḥ |\nna sa siddhimavāpnoti na sukhaṃ na parāṃ gatim ||","read":"yah shaastravidhimutsrijya vartate kaamakaaratah |\nna sa siddhimavaapnoti na sukham na paraam gatim ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"He who, having cast aside the ordinances of the Scriptures, followeth the promptings of desire, attaineth not to perfection, nor happiness, nor the highest goal.","en2":"He who, setting aside the ordinance of the Shâstra, acts under the impulse of desire, attains not to perfection, nor happiness, nor the Goal Supreme.","en2r":null,"rv":null},{"v":24,"sp":"krishna","spm":null,"spl":null,"spp":null,"sa":"तस्माच्छास्त्रं प्रमाणं ते कार्याकार्यव्यवस्थितौ ।\nज्ञात्वा शास्त्रविधानोक्तं कर्म कर्तुमिहार्हसि ॥","iast":"tasmācchāstraṃ pramāṇaṃ te kāryākāryavyavasthitau |\njñātvā śāstravidhānoktaṃ karma kartumihārhasi ||","read":"tasmaachchhaastram pramaanam te kaaryaakaaryavyavasthitau |\njnaatvaa shaastravidhaanoktam karma kartumihaarhasi ||","spli":null,"splr":null,"en":"Therefore let the Scriptures be thy authority, in determining what ought to be done, or what ought not to be done. Knowing what hath been declared by the ordinances of the Scriptures, thou oughtest to work in this world.","en2":"So let the Shâstra be thy authority in ascertaining what ought to be done and what ought not to be done. Having known what is said in the ordinance of the Shâstra, thou shouldst act here.","en2r":null,"rv":null}];
